{"posts":[{"id":"fishing_p8_176","t":"Finally monday! Looking at Usdcad.. I think we can pop a bit from here.","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#176","p":8,"im":["30b5f04b317a75a06489ac7a90ee0136776a0127","25bd05a7e7978f6a75fbeadaf570a90e9e450597","cb1b2897ed30b854d1bb73878164a37f55fa0e70"],"m":176},{"id":"fishing_p8_177","t":"update: was stopped out initially price wanted to go to lower level. Bought again after pop","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#177","p":8,"im":["d41502c2c131718638edc2e5014c95ed13d6fecb"],"m":177},{"id":"fishing_p8_178","t":"Perfect reaction from the FL","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#178","p":8,"im":["d57521cd785e133c482669c90040e12fc59b0357"],"m":178},{"id":"fishing_p8_179","t":"Nicely spotted gizzo! I just had a look on the M5 and its a great little zone. Had to zoom a little bit out to see it on my screen though:)","a":"ShadowPit","d":"","n":"#179","p":8,"im":[],"m":179},{"id":"fishing_p8_180","t":"ShadowPit wrote: Nicely spotted gizzo! I just had a look on the M5 and its a great little zone. Had to zoom a little bit out to see it on my screen though:)\n\nTy mate:) Had a PO-order from yesterday I think at this FL I think a lot of BO-sellers got trapped here today","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#180","p":8,"im":[],"m":180},{"id":"fishing_p8_181","t":"Update","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#181","p":8,"im":["e27ead70d34afbd3e16d7ca01557c5d8e0246370"],"fa":"به‌روزرسانی","m":181},{"id":"fishing_p8_182","t":"Quick trade on GA. Love these levels","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#182","p":8,"im":["52f62e1db01412480ab6463e3329426202a4b62e"],"m":182},{"id":"fishing_p8_183","t":"Hi Gizzo,\n\nLove your journal.\n\nCan you tell me how you would trade this scenario??\n\nI already traded it with a buy and got heavy DD","a":"Madmoney","d":"","n":"#183","p":8,"im":["86d05db56fc73676c8131516c581dddd588deb06"],"m":183},{"id":"fishing_p8_184","t":"Also I've been looking through your screenshot and was wondering why you didn't go long on the bullish engulf???","a":"Madmoney","d":"","n":"#184","p":8,"im":["af723bfc3be0b502ebbb1b328f4d357905906677"],"m":184},{"id":"fishing_p8_185","t":"Madmoney wrote: Hi Gizzo,\n\nLove your journal.\n\nCan you tell me how you would trade this scenario??\n\nI already traded it with a buy and got heavy DD\n\nTy you for stopping by MM:)\n\nMy thoughts","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#185","p":8,"im":["86d05db56fc73676c8131516c581dddd588deb06","e9aa3755bc2d6424bbdf96d63b3415a7fa81f268","d344057dcb54af7b9640af6537ef1ad499c2b4ee","d1c60653a52f372a09a4ba15f8c68e4e290ef70d","00643e17fd80e0ddc20bfb48dfb8788d3bc35298"],"m":185},{"id":"fishing_p8_186","t":"Thank you for your answer.\n\nI've tried to scout one out for myself and have tried to do it in the same order you have done.\n\nIs this correct?","a":"Madmoney","d":"","n":"#186","p":8,"im":["ef75889f44695208251484e8a36adee65100a0f1","ed8790384ce31acf9908d1cdea8a0280280ad73b","d2ed9dbce7cf53382b5d93afc7892c6c17077ffa","037cdf4306662d44972e28e17e8d0242bb4d5484"],"m":186},{"id":"fishing_p8_187","t":"Last trades is closed and now I will take some time off to rest and just be with the family. Some weeks you feel you are in the zone and this was one of those weeks. A quick weekly summary:\n\nTotal pips gained: 618 Total gain: 22.36%\n\nI closed the trade because I dont want to have any exposure over the weekend.\n\nHappy weekend all! Now its time to have an Oktoberfest bier","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#187","p":8,"im":["286dd53026c9eb263aa6db56a4be5bcc618a1548","79b3f10512da6a67fc151be67a6fa580ceed4e00"],"m":187},{"id":"fishing_p8_188","t":"are madmoney from forex factory?\n\nMadmoney wrote: Thank you for your answer.\n\nI've tried to scout one out for myself and have tried to do it in the same order you have done.\n\nIs this correct?","a":"dudu112","d":"","n":"#188","p":8,"im":["ef75889f44695208251484e8a36adee65100a0f1","ed8790384ce31acf9908d1cdea8a0280280ad73b","d2ed9dbce7cf53382b5d93afc7892c6c17077ffa","037cdf4306662d44972e28e17e8d0242bb4d5484"],"m":188},{"id":"fishing_p8_189","t":"Nice Trade - Congrats\n\nI also look for engulfs on higher timeframes H4 for an extra confirmation to get involved in a trade. However I also look for where price might encounter some trouble FTA first trouble area on the H4 before hopefully hitting the target and either take some profit or go to BE at that area. Just my 2 cents.\n\nRegards, Hans","a":"hansma","d":"","n":"#189","p":8,"im":["5c24d7aece7ee501464a0b8ed2203861a314f6fe"],"m":189},{"id":"fishing_p8_190","t":"Who is madmoney from forex factory?","a":"Madmoney","d":"","n":"#190","p":8,"im":[],"m":190},{"id":"fishing_p8_191","t":"Not so many trades this week...\n\nOctober coming to an end and will try to summarize my month","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#191","p":8,"im":["5fefeac2f059eff945aa0e9fdc1824183c7438fc","841c5282017cceb05c64b2499a1fd39bcf810fb5"],"m":191},{"id":"fishing_p8_192","t":"","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#192","p":8,"im":["3da629ded053c7bd9221ffa5d49682d0eaf7491a"],"m":192},{"id":"fishing_p8_193","t":"ohh you... always looking for the best discount","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#193","p":8,"im":[],"m":193},{"id":"fishing_p8_194","t":"I wish my Wife would miss most of the \"best discounts\" too...\n\nGizzo, you are doing Great Man.\n\nI really enjoy your journal. Keep posting. Thank you","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#194","p":8,"im":[],"m":194},{"id":"fishing_p8_195","t":"Hahha ty so much mates!:) I love it when you stop by my journal Yes my wife has also taught me that you can actually earn money when you buy stuff at discount!!!\n\nWhenever wrote: I wish my Wife would miss most of the \"best discounts\" too...\n\nGizzo, you are doing Great Man. I really enjoy your journal. Keep posting. Thank you","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#195","p":8,"im":["a09c0f66b5bde0f5a497ebe67635b56220c87cbb"],"m":195},{"id":"fishing_p8_196","t":"very good call on EG. Had marked it as well but hesitated and now I watch you riding it on the sidelines\n\nI suppose skiing holiday should not be in Norway next season but in Northtern Sweden where you could give me lessons","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#196","p":8,"im":[],"m":196},{"id":"fishing_p8_197","t":"For sure one of the important Steps of learning skiing (what I cannot do at All yet) is not to exceed in self confidence. If you feel that in that particular day that line was not for you, you better just skip it. I guess in Trading the translation should be: no greed. (And I am as good at that as in skiing yet.... ) There will be tons of Trades tomorrow.\n\nGreat Entry Gizzo. You do it amazing good. I was not following that pair ( And have no charts available now ), so also for all the other people here waiting at the Ski-lift, would you mind to show a short analysis of the reason of that rocket (apart of the news)?\n\nThanks a lot You rock too!","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#197","p":8,"im":[],"m":197},{"id":"fishing_p8_198","t":"waiting at a ski-lift. ahahaha!\n\nMe like your metaphors!","a":"Art","d":"","n":"#198","p":8,"im":[],"m":198},{"id":"fishing_p8_199","t":"Hello my dear friends, hope everyone is doing great! Not so usual for me to trade mondays but ucad hit a really nice and important ftr today","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#199","p":8,"im":["26541d17e130b9e35ea5b78f79d9fd3958bf4024"],"m":199},{"id":"fishing_p8_200","t":"Hello all RTM:ers! Wishing all a good 2016! Im fully back from holidays now trading and started the year with some aussitrading!","a":"gizzo","d":"","n":"#200","p":8,"im":["93ec761a7a80fd88a8b64e7f71ef08375451fe6d"],"m":200}],"images":[{"k":"af723bfc3be0b502ebbb1b328f4d357905906677","t":"assets/thumbs/af723bfc3be0b502ebbb1b328f4d357905906677.webp","f":"assets/images/af723bfc3be0b502ebbb1b328f4d357905906677.png","w":1366,"h":581,"b":40616,"o":"af723bfc3be0b502ebbb1b328f4d357905906677.png","p":8,"pid":"fishing_p8_184"},{"k":"30b5f04b317a75a06489ac7a90ee0136776a0127","t":"assets/thumbs/30b5f04b317a75a06489ac7a90ee0136776a0127.webp","f":"assets/images/30b5f04b317a75a06489ac7a90ee0136776a0127.jpeg","w":1360,"h":561,"b":59746,"o":"30b5f04b317a75a06489ac7a90ee0